			    -*-   PRESENTS   -*-


                      ULTRASCAN  0.93  FOR DAYDREAM BBS

                                   By Zed


What is it?
~~~~~~~~~~~
	It's two FileLister doors. One for REVERSE (FR) and SORTED
	(Alphabetical order!!). They arn't ASM written but the FR
	door is faster than DreamNew!! US_Sorted is quiet fast also,
	considering the little amount of memory it allocates (8k!!).


Requirements:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
	DayDream BBS       (Any recent version)
	HBasic2.library    (if you can't get a hold of it, EMail me!)


Installation:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~
	Copy UltraScan.CFG to DayDream:Configs/

	The door also looks for DayDream:Display/XXX/UltraScan.cfg, but
	falls back to DayDream:Configs/UltraScan.cfg. This means you
	can have different config for each display type.

	Copy US_Reverse and US_Sorted to DOORS:

	Run them as normal DDDP doors! ie Doors:US_Reverse %N


Note:
~~~~~
	You can unflag files! (With arrows or by pressing F).
	These doors work with both 18 and 13 char filenames.




